  "description": "The Master of Education (MEd) program engages educational practitioners in rigorous education. By engaging students with substantive scholarship, they develop educational expertise in various areas, to become leaders in the field of education. The MEd program includes four concentrations: curriculum and instruction, literacy, inclusion specialist, and educational leadership. The MEd program serves teachers, administrators, and educators more generally who desire to grow personally and professionally through advanced education.",
